  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed front-facing dormer constitutes a flat-roofed box structure positioned prominently on the principal roof slope of the dwelling. By reason of its bulky, box-like form, lack of subservience to the host roof, and siting on an otherwise unbroken and cohesive front roofscape shared with adjoining properties, it would appear as a visually intrusive and discordant addition. As such, the proposal conflicts with Policies DMD 13 and DMD 37 of the Enfield Development Management Document (2014), Policy CP30 of the Enfield Core Strategy (2010), Policy D4 of the London Plan (2021), and Section 12 of the National Planning Policy Framework (December 2024)."
